# User Utilities

This rule covers utility functions used within the user management system.

## Result Type

*   A generic `Result` type (`{ success: true; value: T } | { success: false; error: E }`) is defined in [result.ts](mdc:src/core/user/result.ts).
*   This type is used in server actions to handle operations that might succeed or fail, providing a structured way to return either a value or an error.

